			"Message": "chore(deps): Update dependencies and GitHub Actions workflows\n\nThis commit updates various dependencies across the project, including Rust crates, Node.js packages, and GitHub Actions versions. Key updates include:\n\n- Updated Tauri dependencies (tauri, tauri-plugin-dialog, tauri-plugin-fs) to newer versions.\n- Bumped numerous Rust crate versions in Cargo.toml.\n- Updated several devDependencies in package.json, such as @biomejs/biome, prettier, tailwindcss, and turbo.\n- Upgraded GitHub Actions in workflow files: actions/checkout, actions/setup-node, pnpm/action-setup, actions/upload-artifact, and actions/cache.\n- Removed --provenance flag from npm publish command in NPM.yml workflow.\n- Changed link-workspace-packages setting in .npmrc from true to deep.\n- Removed extends field from turbo.json.\n- Deleted multiple IntelliJ IDEA configuration files (.idea/*) that were previously tracked.\n- Updated Element and Dependency submodules to their latest commits.\n\nThese changes aim to keep the project up-to-date with the latest tooling and dependency improvements, potentially bringing performance enhancements, bug fixes, and new features. Removing the IntelliJ configuration files reduces repository clutter, assuming these are user-specific settings.",
